'''Mt. Moon Summit''' is an area accessed from the [[Mt. Moon Square]] by entering through the South Entrance of [[Mt. Moon]] on [[Route 4|Route 4.]]

It contains patches of grass, the observatory, and clouds that can be accessed for the [[Legendary Pokémon|Meloetta quest]].

